flowchart LR
    I[Input image] --> P[CLIP patch evidence]
    T[Normality prompts] --> A[Normality anchor evidence]
    P --> HP[Hyperbolic patch embedding]
    A --> HA[Hyperbolic normality acceptance anchors]
    HP --> C[Normality acceptance cost]
    HA --> C
    C --> UOT[Rejectable acceptance via UOT]
    UOT --> M[High-cost accepted evidence]
    UOT --> U[Unaccepted mass]
    M --> S[Acceptance-failure score]
    U --> S
    S --> H[Pixel-level anomaly map]

    subgraph Controls
        FC[Cosine / Euclidean cost]
        BOT[Balanced OT / no rejectable acceptance]
        NC[Random / unrelated / anomaly-only anchors]
    end

    FC -. ablation .-> C
    BOT -. ablation .-> UOT
    NC -. negative control .-> HA
